sequenceDiagram
    participant A as External AI agent / MCP client
    participant M as Camel MCP server
    participant T as Shared Camel tool routes
    participant D as JDBC database
    A->>M: tools/call get_claim_details(CLM-1001)
    M->>T: claim-details-tool / direct:lookupClaim
    T->>D: Parameterized claim query
    D-->>T: Claim facts, memberId MEM-501
    T-->>M: Tool result
    M-->>A: MCP result
    A->>M: tools/call get_member_coverage(MEM-501)
    M->>T: member-coverage-tool / direct:lookupCoverage
    T->>D: Parameterized coverage query
    D-->>T: Coverage facts
    T-->>M: Tool result
    M-->>A: MCP result
    A->>A: Use facts in its own workflow
